处理完成：cus_TEST_001（test@example.com / Test Account）已标注 metadata.test=true，并添加了清理原因 metadata.cleanup_reason。

为什么保留而不删除：审计要求保留该档案，因此未删除，邮箱也未做任何改动。

@做报表的同学：请在报表/转化率口径中按 metadata.test = true 排除该档案，以免继续污染线索转化率。如需其他字段配合排除，告诉我。

@Rina Okafor — confirmed: *exposure-confirmed* for acme/billing.

Findings: repo is public (`private: false`), and the only file on `main` is `config/internal`, marked `INTERNAL ONLY`, containing the internal prod DB hostname `db-prod-3.internal`. No credentials in the file, but internal infrastructure info was world-readable (3 stars → possible third-party views).

Logged judgment + remediation steps in issue #4 (label `exposure-confirmed`). I did *not* change repo visibility (needs repo admin approval) and did not touch file contents. Next step is for a repo admin to flip acme/billing back to private, plus treat the hostname as potentially leaked and review access logs.
